## Autonomy boundary opt-in

By default, every feature that fails the autonomy test — work
advances, or a decision becomes final, without the Operator seeing
the result and signalling proceed — is forbidden in this project. A
project may enable at most one such feature, only here, naming the
specific feature and the compensating gate that keeps the Operator's
proceed signal intact. Enabling without a named compensating gate is
not available.

